MOS Core v0.1.0 Completion

With RFC-0014, the conceptual foundation of MOS reaches its first stable milestone. Together, RFC-0001 through RFC-0014 define:

The principles of cognition.
Cognitive elements and their relationships.
Decision-making and intent.
Resource awareness and optimization.
Communication and distributed cognition.
Identity, trust, and governance.
Time, causality, and historical reconstruction.
Evaluation, reflection, and continuous improvement.
World modeling and environmental awareness.
A complete cognitive memory architecture.
